## How this folder was made

This README was a `README.md.ft$` file in the template. Files whose names end
in `.ft$` get their tokens filled in (the client and project names above were
tokens), and the `.ft$` is dropped. Tokens nobody declared, like
{{$notAParameter}}, are left exactly as written.

- `client` and `project` renamed the folders and files that contained
  `{client}` and `{project}`.
- `year` uses a custom match, `\{yyyy\}`, so the template writes `{yyyy}` in
  names instead of `{year}`.
- A parameter with no name and the match `^_Template - ` strips that prefix
  from every name. It is why the template folder is called
  `_Template - {client} - {project}` but this folder is not.
- `studio` has no prompt, so nobody is asked: it always uses its default.
